{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"21691","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/21691","key":"MC-276638","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"12/Sep/24 7:27 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>The server console or LAN game output spammed with \"PLAYER moved too quickly!\" after a player dies and respawns.</p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Server console</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">[22:14:14 INFO]: [Les3awe: Killed Les3awe]\n[22:14:15 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! -11.28453520303416,-2.116501367928123,-62.12911357204942\n[22:16:31 INFO]: Les3awe was killed\n[22:16:31 INFO]: [Les3awe: Killed Les3awe]\n[22:16:39 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! -46.13969726382189,-14.112930305474706,-93.73915427829289\n[22:16:46 INFO]: Les3awe was killed\n[22:16:46 INFO]: [Les3awe: Killed Les3awe]\n[22:16:47 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! -35.19694635972356,-3.243413216081791,-13.679489466242739\n[22:16:47 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! -35.19694635972356,-3.243413216081791,-13.679489466242739\n[22:16:51 INFO]: Les3awe was killed\n[22:16:51 INFO]: [Les3awe: Killed Les3awe]\n[22:16:52 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! 5.169859688363443,-2.8685985614118863,-33.594936090566605\n[22:16:52 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! 5.169859688363443,-2.8685985614118863,-33.594936090566605\n[22:16:52 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! 5.169859688363443,-2.8685985614118863,-33.594936090566605\n[22:16:52 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! 5.169859688363443,-2.8685985614118863,-33.594936090566605\n[22:16:52 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! 5.169859688363443,-2.8685985614118863,-33.594936090566605\n[22:16:52 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! 5.169859688363443,-2.8685985614118863,-33.594936090566605\n[22:16:52 WARN]: Les3awe moved too quickly! 5.169859688363443,-2.8685985614118863,-33.594936090566605\n\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Stepstoreproduce\"></a>Steps to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Join the official vanilla dedicated server.</li>\n\t<li>Move 3 chunks away from the respawn point. <b>No need to use the teleport command.</b></li>\n\t<li>Use the following command:\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/kill @p</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Click the \"Respawn\" button.</li>\n\t<li>Noticed some spam on the server console or LAN game output.</li>\n</ol>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"12/Sep/24 2:53 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/38637","id":"38637","filename":"2024-09-15_20_53_21-1_18t-24w37a.zip","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/60bfe4e2c90cb200683113e3/a59781d1-0534-49ca-90ad-39bae706c3c8/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/60bfe4e2c90cb200683113e3/a59781d1-0534-49ca-90ad-39bae706c3c8/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/60bfe4e2c90cb200683113e3/a59781d1-0534-49ca-90ad-39bae706c3c8/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/60bfe4e2c90cb200683113e3/a59781d1-0534-49ca-90ad-39bae706c3c8/32"},"displayName":"[Mod]Les3awe","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"15/Sep/24 5:55 AM","size":"305 kB","mimeType":"application/zip","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/38637"}],"versions":null,"resolutiond